OL,3,AUS judge blocks deportation of DoorDash
OL,4,Adriver shot by ICE
OL,5,
OL,6,FA US judge has temporarily blocked the
OL,7,Fdeportation of a Venezuelan man who was
OL,8,Fshot by immigration agents in Texas,
OL,9,Fhis lawyer says.
OL,11,FWilber Rafael Garces Perez, 28, is
OL,12,Fbeing held in a detention centre with a
OL,13,Fbullet in his back, according to his
OL,14,Flawyer. Judge Orlando Garcia, a Clinton
OL,15,Fappointee, scheduled a hearing for
OL,16,FGarces Perez to appear in court in
OL,17,Fperson next week.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
