OL,3,AUS judge blocks deportation of DoorDash
OL,4,Adriver shot by ICE
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department of Homeland Security
OL,7,F(DHS) said in a statement that an
OL,8,F"illegal alien" had been the subject of
OL,9,Fa targeted vehicle stop but pushed back
OL,10,Fagainst suggestions he had been given
OL,11,Finadequate medical care.
OL,13,FThe incident comes months after a US
OL,14,FImmigration and Customs Enforcement
OL,15,F(ICE) officer fatally shot a man in
OL,16,FHouston.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
